/E (Therefore, the proposed Hybrid Super-Resolution Assisted Frequency-Routed Capsule Network framework aims to bridge this gap by integrating Super-Resolution enhancement with advanced feature extraction and classification mechanisms. This approach is expected to improve both image quality and classification accuracy while maintaining computational efficiency.)
