/T (ENCODER SECTION: Weproceed to the encoder section by implementing a downsample function that reduces the spatial dimensions of the input tensor with an increase in depth. Each downsample operation uses a 4x4 convolutional layer with a specified number of filters. )
/E (ENCODER SECTION: Weproceed to the encoder section by implementing a downsample function that reduces the spatial dimensions of the input tensor with an increase in depth. Each downsample operation uses a 4x4 convolutional layer with a specified number of filters. )
