763 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 342 0 R
/T (DECODER SECTION: The decoder sectionmirrors the encoder but in reverse. This is done by using upsample operations to increase spatial dimensions while decreasing depth .Each upsample operation is paired with a 4x4 transposed convolutional layer \(Conv2DTranspose\) except for the last two layers that use a 2x2 transposed convolutional layer. )
/E (DECODER SECTION: The decoder sectionmirrors the encoder but in reverse. This is done by using upsample operations to increase spatial dimensions while decreasing depth .Each upsample operation is paired with a 4x4 transposed convolutional layer \(Conv2DTranspose\) except for the last two layers that use a 2x2 transposed convolutional layer. )
/Pg 39 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
