<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 349 0 R
/T (The proposed system can achieve good performance with relatively smaller datasets compared to more data-hungry models, reducing data requirements and training time. It is also well-suited for tasks such as image denoising, image compression, anomaly detection, and image-to-image translation, providing versatility in application areas. The proposed system can also generalize well to unseen data and is capable of adapting to different domains with minor adjustments to training strategies. )
/E (The proposed system can achieve good performance with relatively smaller datasets compared to more data-hungry models, reducing data requirements and training time. It is also well-suited for tasks such as image denoising, image compression, anomaly detection, and image-to-image translation, providing versatility in application areas. The proposed system can also generalize well to unseen data and is capable of adapting to different domains with minor adjustments to training strategies. )
/Pg 46 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
