/T ( The proposed approach in this study involves an end-to-end fully convolutional network aimed at directly modeling the intricate nonlinear mapping between face photos and sketches. Experimental findings underscore the efficacy of the fully convolutional network in adeptly addressing this challenging task, facilitating pixel-wise predictions with both effectiveness and efficiency. )
/E ( The proposed approach in this study involves an end-to-end fully convolutional network aimed at directly modeling the intricate nonlinear mapping between face photos and sketches. Experimental findings underscore the efficacy of the fully convolutional network in adeptly addressing this challenging task, facilitating pixel-wise predictions with both effectiveness and efficiency. )
/Pg 47 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
